    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Mental Mutation</strong></p>\n<p>Your mind has become so aberrant and foreign that you just don’t think like almost any other sentient entity. Attempts to determine your emotions, thoughts, motivations and Ambitions receive a -30 modifier and you get a +20 modifier to resist magic and abilities that try to influence or control your emotions or thoughts. Anyone using telepathy to create a connection with your mind must pass a <b>Challenging (+0) Cool</b> Test or gain the @Condition[Stunned] Condition. You make people around you deeply uncomfortable and you gain -20 Fellowship. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
